AWS Wavelength: Deploy compute infrastructure directly within telecom 5G networks to minimize physical latency.
Amazon EC2: Host the authoritative game server, execute the eBPF network routing, and run the Mamba AI model.
Amazon VPC: Manage secure network routing and Carrier IPs between the 5G edge node and mobile clients.
Amazon S3: Store large parsed match telemetry datasets, AI model weights, and long-term gameplay logs.
AWS IAM: Secure access and strictly define permissions for edge nodes and developer resources.
Amazon CloudWatch: Monitor real-time edge node performance, system health, and dropped-packet network telemetry.


